sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pesquisador
    participant FE as useConsensusPage
    participant R as routes/consensus.py
    participant UC as usecases/consensus.py
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant W as _dh_consensus_worker
    participant DH as DrugHunter perform_consensus
    participant FS as resultados/consenso

    U->>FE: Escolhe receptor e ligante de referência
    FE->>R: GET /redocking-jobs (pré-preenche pdb_id, ligante)
    FE->>R: POST /api/consensus/iniciar
    R->>UC: uc_iniciar_consensus
    UC->>DB: exige ADMET done e cria job (running)
    UC->>UC: _combinar_moleculas → molecules.csv
    UC->>W: thread → run_consensus_worker (PATH com Dock6 e Chimera)
    W->>W: instala shim de sphere_selector e patches Dock6 6.13
    W->>DH: perform_consensus(...)
    DH->>DH: SMILES → pdbqt (OpenBabel)
    DH->>DH: AutoDock Vina
    DH->>DH: melhor pose → mol2 (Chimera)
    DH->>DH: Dock6 (superfície, esferas, grid, footprint)
    DH->>DH: generate_consensus (z-score e min-max)
    DH->>FS: alvo.csv e correlation.png
    W-->>UC: done
    UC->>DB: done, mol_count, caminhos
    UC->>UC: e-mail de conclusão
    loop A cada 4 s
        FE->>R: GET /{job_id}
    end
    FE->>R: GET /by-admet/{id}, /download, /correlation
